    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parts Unknown International is an online fighting game aiming to recapture the spirit of old fighting games with a unique style. It gives the player different fighting styles to master. If you loved games like Def Jam Vendetta, Street Fighter, Ready 2 Rumble Boxing, or The Warriors, then you are sure to love this game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic street fighting games like Def Jam Fight For NY, Parts Unknown combines stylish in depth fighting styles, beautiful music, and an online experience to keep you engaged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parts Unknown is a third person fighting game innovating ReadyPlayerMe technology to create a metaverse experience. Play as an orphan who has to fight for a reputation in order to save the orphanage you will meet different characters and crews along your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game in its current state features 3 open worlds, a gym to workout, different fighting styles, and autosave. Online Multiplayer is now available.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parts Unknown International is an online fighting game aiming to recapture the spirit of old fighting games with a unique style. It gives the player different fighting styles to master. If you loved games like Def Jam Vendetta, Street Fighter, Ready 2 Rumble Boxing, or The Warriors, then you are sure to love this game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic street fighting games like Def Jam Fight For NY, Parts Unknown combines stylish in depth fighting styles, beautiful music, and an online experience to keep you engaged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parts Unknown is a third person fighting game innovating ReadyPlayerMe technology to create a metaverse experience. Play as an orphan who has to fight for a reputation in order to save the orphanage you will meet different characters and crews along your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game in its current state features 3 open worlds, a gym to workout, different fighting styles, and autosave. Online Multiplayer is now available.</p>",
